## Data Flow Architecture

### Request Phase
```
User Query
    ↓
investment-orchestrator.md
    ├── Parse query type (investment, strategy, etc.)
    ├── Extract context (opportunity, constraints, etc.)
    ├── Determine agent subset (usually all 5)
    └── Spawn 5 parallel agents via Task tool
```

### Analysis Phase
```
Each Agent in Parallel:
    ├── Load persona-specific knowledge
    ├── Retrieve relevant skill references
    ├── Apply decision framework
    ├── Conduct web research if needed
    ├── Generate structured analysis
