## Error Handling & Fallbacks

### Agent Timeout
- Timeout: 60 seconds per agent analysis
- Fallback: Return "timeout - insufficient analysis" to synthesizer
- Synthesizer: Continues with available analyses (can work with N-1)

### Bad Analysis Quality
- Detector: Synthesizer checks for minimum confidence threshold
- Fallback: Flag in final output as "lower confidence due to analysis gaps"
- User: Informed which analyses contributed less

